<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle c_{5}(G,q,t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle c_{5}(G,q,t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{PrivacyRisk}(G,q)\cdot w_{privacy}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>PrivacyRisk</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{PrivacyRisk}(G,q)\cdot w_{privacy}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Each dimension has an associated adaptive weight <math id="S3.SS3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{d}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{d}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> that responds to system conditions:</p>
<table id="S3.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{d}(t)=w_{d,base}\cdot\exp(\eta_{d}\cdot\Delta_{d}(t))" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{d}(t)=w_{d,base}\cdot\exp(\eta_{d}\cdot\Delta_{d}(t))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS3.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{d}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{d}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> represents the deviation from baseline conditions and <math id="S3.SS3.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> controls sensitivity.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">The complete cost function becomes:</p>
<table id="S3.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{C}(G,q,t)=\sum_{d=1}^{D}w_{d}(t)\cdot c_{d}(G,q,t)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐂</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{C}(G,q,t)=\sum_{d=1}^{D}w_{d}(t)\cdot c_{d}(G,q,t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dynamic Priority Adaptation:</span> Query priority is modeled through a multi-factor function:</p>
<table id="S3.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho(q)=\rho_{base}\cdot\prod_{k=1}^{K}\rho_{k}(q_{k})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.055em">⋅</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho(q)=\rho_{base}\cdot\prod_{k=1}^{K}\rho_{k}(q_{k})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p6.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS3.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> represents different query characteristics (domain, complexity, user type) and <math id="S3.SS3.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> are learned priority functions.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">System load adaptation follows:</p>
<table id="S3.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(t)=\begin{cases}1.0&amp;\text{if }L(t)\leq L_{normal}\\
1+\beta\cdot\log\left(\frac{L(t)}{L_{normal}}\right)&amp;\text{if }L(t)&gt;L_{normal}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>1.0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(t)=\begin{cases}1.0&amp;\text{if }L(t)\leq L_{normal}\\
1+\beta\cdot\log\left(\frac{L(t)}{L_{normal}}\right)&amp;\text{if }L(t)&gt;L_{normal}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">The final dynamic penalty coefficient becomes:</p>
<table id="S3.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda(q,t)=\lambda_{\text{base}}\cdot\rho(q)\cdot\sigma(t)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda(q,t)=\lambda_{\text{base}}\cdot\rho(q)\cdot\sigma(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p9.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S3.F3" title="Fig. 3 ‣ III-C Multi-Objective Dynamic Cost Optimization ‣ III Methodology ‣ AutoMaAS: Self-Evolving Multi-Agent Architecture Search for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> visualizes the multi-dimensional cost tensor and adaptive weighting mechanism.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F3" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.F3.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="159.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 277.09 159.52" width="277.09"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,159.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(138.55,0) translate(0,25.08)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#6666FF;--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9FF;" fill="#D9D9FF" stroke="#6666FF"><path d="M -87.74 121.56 L -132.73 121.56 C -135.79 121.56 -138.27 119.08 -138.27 116.03 L -138.27 104.44 C -138.27 101.39 -135.79 98.91 -132.73 98.91 L -87.74 98.91 C -84.68 98.91 -82.2 101.39 -82.2 104.44 L -82.2 116.03 C -82.2 119.08 -84.68 121.56 -87.74 121.56 Z M -138.27 98.91"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -135.04 114.97)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.52em;--ltx-fo-height:0.35em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="23.14" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.8)" width="104.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:7.52em;">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Token Cost <math id="S3.F3.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{1}(G,q,t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{1}(G,q,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#6666FF;--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9FF;" fill="#D9D9FF" stroke="#6666FF"><path d="M -32.62 121.53 L -77.61 121.53 C -80.67 121.53 -83.15 119.05 -83.15 115.99 L -83.15 104.48 C -83.15 101.42 -80.67 98.94 -77.61 98.94 L -32.62 98.94 C -29.56 98.94 -27.09 101.42 -27.09 104.48 L -27.09 115.99 C -27.09 119.05 -29.56 121.53 -32.62 121.53 Z M -83.15 98.94"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -79.92 115.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.52em;--ltx-fo-height:0.34em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="23.04" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.7)" width="104.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:7.52em;">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">API Cost <math id="S3.F3.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{2}(G,q,t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{2}(G,q,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#6666FF;--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9FF;" fill="#D9D9FF" stroke="#6666FF"><path d="M 22.5 121.53 L -22.5 121.53 C -25.55 121.53 -28.03 119.05 -28.03 115.99 L -28.03 104.48 C -28.03 101.42 -25.55 98.94 -22.5 98.94 L 22.5 98.94 C 25.55 98.94 28.03 101.42 28.03 104.48 L 28.03 115.99 C 28.03 119.05 25.55 121.53 22.5 121.53 Z M -28.03 98.94"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -24.8 115.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.52em;--ltx-fo-height:0.34em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="23.04" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.7)" width="104.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:7.52em;">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.3.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
