<div id="S4.SS4.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p7.1" class="ltx_p">The most successful fusion (CoT + Self-Refine) reduces token consumption by 18% while improving accuracy by 4.2%, demonstrating the effectiveness of automatic operator discovery.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS4.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S4.F4" title="Fig. 4 ‣ IV-D Ablation Studies ‣ IV Experimental Evaluation ‣ AutoMaAS: Self-Evolving Multi-Agent Architecture Search for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> visualizes the operator evolution process during training.</p>
</div>
